📖 Overview

The circuit diagram represents the complete hardware connection of the Smart Electronic Voting Machine (EVM).

It shows how the Arduino UNO interfaces with the authentication, input, display, audio, and indication modules to perform the required voting operations.

---

🧩 Hardware Modules

Module| Function
🟢 Arduino UNO| Main controller of the system
🔐 Fingerprint Sensor| Voter authentication
🎙️ Voice Module| Voice instructions and guidance
📺 LCD Display| Displays system messages and voting instructions
🔘 Push Buttons| Candidate selection
💡 LEDs| System status indication
🔔 Buzzer| Audio feedback and confirmation

