⚙️ Working Relationship

The hardware modules work together in the following sequence:

Fingerprint Authentication
↓
System Access
↓
LCD / Voice Guidance
↓
Candidate Selection through Push Buttons
↓
Vote Recording
↓
Buzzer / LED Confirmation

